commit 7f74e3a8020b9179a670aa820cf900915d8fb4d1

C03: a bare launch of a game no catalog holds reads the Steam library (INSTALL1633)

«lanzá Mortal Kombat» names no platform, and neither the installed-game catalog nor the Start catalog holds the name; the launch path had nothing to launch and the request reached the model. Games are launched from Steam on this PC, so a launch («lanzá», «jugá», «launch») of a plain one-to-four-word name now reads game.entitlement.named — after installed games, near names and catalog applications keep their own paths — and the composer says the game is not in the person's Steam library, so it cannot be launched. «corré git status» stays outside (no launch verb).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


